    {
      "at": [
        -50,
        -36
      ],
      "id": 27,
      "text": "Buzzers (SN-228): the Blue Pill plays a C major scale on a passive buzzer straight from TIM2 CH1 (PA0, the note's\nfrequency, through 220 ohm), then beeps an active buzzer through an IRLZ44N (PB0). Run and listen (Windows: Simulate > Sound);\nhold SW1 to mute the scale. The buzzers show the frequency they sound at."
    }
